\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. How shall a sinner find
\par The Saviour of mankind?
\par Canst Thou not accept my prayer?
\par Not bestow the grace I claim?
\par Where are Thy old mercies? Where
\par Where all the powers of Jesu's name?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I will not let Thee go
\par Till I Thy mercy know;
\par Let me here the welcome sound,
\par Speak, if still Thou canst forgive;
\par Speak, and let the lost be found:
\par Speak and let the dying live.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thy love is all my plea,
\par Thy passion speaks for me;
\par By Thy pangs and bloody sweat, 
\par By Thy death of grief unknown,
\par Save me, gasping at Thy feet,
\par Save, O save Thy ransomed one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. What hast thou done for me?
\par O think on Calvary!
\par By Thy mortal groans and sighs,
\par By Thy precious blood I pray,
\par Hear my dying spirit cries,
\par Take, O take my sins away! 
\par                                 Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

